<task id="SRFR-039" project="set-regarding-and-field-mapping-resolver-r1">
  <metadata>
    <title>RegardingResolver v1.3.3 → v1.3.4 — restore Row 2 Name cell inline (1/3 : 2/3 grid) with top-aligned OOB-parity labels ("Regarding Number" / "Regarding Name")</title>
    <status>completed</status>
    <estimated-effort>1h30min</estimated-effort>
    <actual-effort>~55min</actual-effort>
    <assigned>AI Agent</assigned>
    <started>2026-07-03</started>
    <completed>2026-07-03</completed>
    <rigor>FULL</rigor>
    <parallel-safe>true</parallel-safe>
    <parallel-group>—</parallel-group>
    <tags>pcf,regarding-resolver,fluent-ui,react,styling,version-bump,wave-3-followon,deploy</tags>
    <depends-on>SRFR-037</depends-on>
    <wave>3</wave>
  </metadata>

  <prompt><![CDATA[
Out-of-plan owner correction to SRFR-034 §6 (which removed the Name cell entirely
from Row 2). Owner wants the Name displayed INSIDE the PCF, next to the
record-number, with proportional widths: Number cell = 1/3 of row width, Name
cell = 2/3 of row width.

Additional owner clarification (mid-task): both cells need OOB-parity top-aligned
labels above the value — "Regarding Number" above the number hyperlink, and
"Regarding Name" above the plain-text name. Label styling to match OOB field
labels on the same form: small font (12px), regular weight, gray color
(#616161).

Scope (all in `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/`):

1. `RegardingResolverApp.tsx`:
   - Row 2 layout: change from single-column single-Link to CSS grid with
     `grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;` (or equivalent Flexbox proportional).
   - LEFT cell (1/3): label "Regarding Number" (Text) above; hyperlinked
     record-number Link below (preserve SRFR-031 modal-open click handler).
   - RIGHT cell (2/3): label "Regarding Name" (Text) above; record-name as
     plain-text Fluent v9 `<Text>` component (NOT a Link — just display).
   - Label styling: fontSize 12px, fontWeight 400, color '#616161'
     (Path A extension for OOB label parity).
   - Value styling: inherit OOB body-text (Segoe UI 14px, #242424, weight 400).
   - Both cells share the same label styling.
   - If either value is null/empty: hide that specific cell (rather than
     render em-dash) so empty state is clean.
   - Restore any Griffel styles for the Name cell that SRFR-034 deleted;
     preserve SRFR-037's title semi-bold weight 600 + reduced top padding.

2. Version bump v1.3.3 → v1.3.4 across all 7 anchors:
   - `ControlManifest.Input.xml` (control root version attr)
   - `index.ts` CONTROL_VERSION
   - `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` BUILD_DATE (leave as 2026-07-03 if same day)
   - `Solution/solution.xml` <Version>
   - `Solution/Controls/sprk_Spaarke.Controls.RegardingResolver/ControlManifest.xml`
     version attr
   - `package.json` version
   - `Solution/pack.ps1` $version

3. Tests (`__tests__/RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx`):
   - Bulk grep + replace 1.3.3 → 1.3.4 (version prop + assertion regex).
   - REPLACE the SRFR-034 §6 tests that assert "no name cell" with tests that
     assert BOTH cells are present.
   - Add: (a) Row 2 has two cells with correct data-testids; (b) Name cell
     renders `<Text>` (plain-text, NOT a Link — hyperlink is only on number);
     (c) labels "Regarding Number" and "Regarding Name" render above cells
     with the expected label className.

4. Step 9.5 quality gates: `/code-review` + `/adr-check` + `npm run build:prod`.

5. Deploy: pack solution, `pac solution import --force-overwrite
   --publish-changes`, verify `pac solution list | grep RegardingResolver`
   shows v1.3.4.

Constraints:
  - ADR-022 virtual pattern preserved.
  - SRFR-034/035/037 features preserved: refresh button, auto-refresh,
    showVersionFooter, PolymorphicPicker consumption, title semi-bold + low
    top padding.
  - ADR-021 Path A exception continues — OOB parity styling extends to Row 2
    labels (12px, weight 400, color #616161).
  - Backward compat: no manifest property removal (regardingRecordNameField
    is re-consumed — was preserved for backcompat since v1.3.1).
  ]]></prompt>

  <role>PCF developer familiar with Spaarke PCF version discipline
  (`src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md`), Fluent v9 Griffel + tokens (`ADR-021`),
  virtual PCF platform-library pattern (`ADR-022`), shared PolymorphicPicker
  (`ADR-012`), and Dataverse OOB field-label styling conventions.</role>

  <goal><![CDATA[
RegardingResolver v1.3.4 deployed to spaarkedev1, verified via
`pac solution list`. Row 2 renders both fields inline: LEFT (1/3 width) is
"Regarding Number" label above the hyperlinked record-number; RIGHT (2/3
width) is "Regarding Name" label above the plain-text record-name.
Labels use OOB-parity styling (12px, weight 400, #616161). Empty cells hide
gracefully. SRFR-034/035/037 features preserved unchanged. All 7 version
anchors bumped 1.3.3 → 1.3.4. `npm run build:prod` passes. Tests updated
to assert BOTH cells present + label rendering.
  ]]></goal>

