  <constraints>
    <constraint source="ADR-022">Virtual PCF pattern preserved. React 16 + Fluent 9 platform-libraries. No bundling regression.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-012">Shared PolymorphicPicker consumption preserved. Do NOT modify the shared component.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021 Path A exception">Title (600 semi-bold) + Row 2 labels (12px, weight 400, #616161) both use hardcoded OOB-parity values. Documented Path A exception (SRFR-034 §4, extended by SRFR-037 for title weight, extended by SRFR-039 for Row 2 labels). All other styles remain on Fluent v9 semantic tokens.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Feature preservation: manual refresh button (SRFR-034), auto-refresh (SRFR-035), showVersionFooter (SRFR-034), PolymorphicPicker consumption (SRFR-030/034), CREATE-mode presave bridge (SRFR-032), title semi-bold + low top padding (SRFR-037) — ALL preserved.</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">Backward compat: no manifest property additions/removals; `regardingRecordNameField` is now re-consumed (was pass-through since v1.3.1 SRFR-034 §6).</constraint>
    <constraint source="src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md — Version Update Checklist">ALL 7 anchors bumped together (manifest, index.ts, footer BUILD_DATE, solution.xml, Solution ControlManifest, package.json, pack.ps1).</constraint>
    <constraint source="project">TypeScript strict mode.</constraint>
  </constraints>

  <knowledge>
    <topic>pcf/version-discipline + Fluent v9 Griffel styling + OOB Dataverse field-label parity</topic>
    <files>
      <file>src/client/pcf/CLAUDE.md</file>
      <file>src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolver/RegardingResolverApp.tsx</file>
    </files>
    <patterns>
      <pattern name="OOB field-label parity" location="RegardingResolverApp.tsx Row 2 label Griffel block">
        Dataverse OOB field labels use small font (~12px), regular weight
        (400), gray color (roughly #616161), left-aligned, positioned above
        the field value. Row 2 restores the Name cell alongside the Number
        cell and adds top-aligned labels for both.
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="1/3 : 2/3 grid layout" location="RegardingResolverApp.tsx Row 2 grid Griffel block">
        `display: 'grid', gridTemplateColumns: '1fr 2fr', gap: (small token)`.
        Left cell is 1/3 width for the number; right cell is 2/3 width for the
        name (names are usually longer than record numbers).
      </pattern>
      <pattern name="Cell hide-on-empty" location="RegardingResolverApp.tsx Row 2 conditional rendering">
        If number is empty, hide the LEFT cell entirely (do NOT render an
        em-dash placeholder). Same for the Name cell. Empty-state UX is
        cleaner than a placeholder character.
      </pattern>
    </patterns>
  </knowledge>

  <context>
    <background>
      SRFR-034 §6 removed the Row 2 record-name cell based on a briefing
      that owner wanted only the number in Row 2 and the OOB name field
      elsewhere. Owner post-v1.3.3 deploy clarified: they want the Name
      INSIDE the PCF, alongside the number. This task restores the Name cell
      with a 1/3 : 2/3 proportional layout AND adds OOB-parity top-aligned
      labels above both cells.
    </background>
    <dependencies>
      <dependency task="SRFR-037" status="completed">v1.3.3 shipped with title font-weight 600 + reduced top padding.</dependency>
    </dependencies>
    <related-work>
      <item>SRFR-041 (parallel) — sprk_todo FormXml revert of SRFR-038 (revert OOB fields to hidden). Different files.</item>
    </related-work>
  </context>

  <steps>
    <step order="0" name="Context Check">Verify context &lt; 60%. Read current `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` Row 2 block. Confirm 7-anchor version state at 1.3.3.</step>
    <step order="1" name="Add label styles">In `RegardingResolverApp.tsx` `useStyles`, add a new `fieldLabel` block: `fontSize: '12px'`, `fontWeight: 400`, `color: '#616161'`, `fontFamily: (Segoe UI stack)`. Add `numberCell` + `nameCell` wrapper blocks so each cell can render label-above-value in flex column layout. Add a `row2Grid` block with `display: 'grid'`, `gridTemplateColumns: '1fr 2fr'`, `gap: tokens.spacingHorizontalS`.</step>
    <step order="2" name="Rewire Row 2 JSX">Replace the current single-Link Row 2 with a two-cell layout:
      - Row 2 root: grid container (row2Grid).
      - Left cell (numberCell): if hasRecordNumber, render Text label "Regarding Number" then Link (record-number, existing click handler preserved).
      - Right cell (nameCell): if boundRecordName is non-empty, render Text label "Regarding Name" then Text (plain-text record-name, NOT a Link).
      - Read `boundRecordName` from `context.parameters.regardingRecordNameField?.raw` (was previously read then discarded — now consumed).
      - Empty cells hide entirely (no em-dash).
    </step>
    <step order="3" name="Update docstring">Bump v1.3.3 references to v1.3.4 in the file docstring header. Add a "# v1.3.4 (SRFR-039 restore Name cell + labels)" section describing the layout change and label styling.</step>
    <step order="4" name="Version bump — Location 1 (ControlManifest.Input.xml)">Update `version="1.3.4"` on the control root element.</step>
    <step order="5" name="Version bump — Location 2 (index.ts CONTROL_VERSION)">Update `CONTROL_VERSION = '1.3.4'`.</step>
    <step order="6" name="Version bump — Location 3 (BUILD_DATE)">Confirm `BUILD_DATE = '2026-07-03'`.</step>
    <step order="7" name="Version bump — Location 4 (Solution manifest)">Update `Solution/solution.xml` `&lt;Version&gt;` to `1.3.4`.</step>
    <step order="8" name="Version bump — Location 5 (Solution Control Manifest)">Update extracted `ControlManifest.xml` version to `1.3.4`.</step>
    <step order="9" name="Version bump — Location 6 (package.json)">Update `package.json` `"version": "1.3.4"`.</step>
    <step order="10" name="Version bump — Location 7 (pack.ps1)">Update `$version = "1.3.4"`.</step>
    <step order="11" name="Tests update">
      In `__tests__/RegardingResolverApp.test.tsx`:
      (a) Bulk replace 1.3.3 → 1.3.4 (version prop + regex).
      (b) Update the SRFR-034 §6 tests that assert "no name cell" — replace with
          tests asserting BOTH cells are present under the new v1.3.4 shape.
      (c) Add 3 new tests: (i) Row 2 has data-testid for number cell AND name
          cell; (ii) Name cell renders `<Text>` component (plain-text, not a
          Link — no href/onClick); (iii) Both labels "Regarding Number" and
          "Regarding Name" render with the expected text content.
    </step>
    <step order="12" name="Grep verification">Grep for `1.3.3` under `src/client/pcf/RegardingResolver/` (exclude node_modules + out + Solution/bin + docstring version-history section). Assert zero non-history hits.</step>
    <step order="9.5" name="Quality Gate">Invoke `/code-review` and `/adr-check` on modified files. Address findings or escalate per CLAUDE.md §6.5.</step>
    <step order="13" name="Build">Run `npm run build:prod`. Confirm build passes.</step>
    <step order="14" name="Test run">Run `npm test`. Confirm all tests pass.</step>
    <step order="15" name="Copy bundle + pack solution">Copy `out/controls/RegardingResolver/bundle.js` to solution controls folder. Run `pack.ps1` to produce `Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.4.zip`.</step>
    <step order="16" name="Deploy">Run `pac solution import --path Solution/bin/RegardingResolverSolution_v1.3.4.zip --force-overwrite --publish-changes` against spaarkedev1. Verify via `pac solution list | Select-String RegardingResolver` shows Version 1.3.4.</step>
    <step order="17" name="Update Task Status">Update SRFR-039 status → completed, notes summary. Update TASK-INDEX.md — add SRFR-039 row. Reset current-task.md.</step>
  </steps>

